.env
# The Claude Code MCP registration stays on the developer's machine (2026-10-14): a
# repo-wide .mcp.json wired every session that opened this folder to candidate data.
# How to register it locally: docs/12-ASK-CLAUDE-MCP.md §4.
.mcp.json
data/
output/
.cache/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
# Frontend
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
# cross-process file-lock sidecars (locking.py) — harmless runtime artifacts
*.lock
# A derived cache, rewritten on most dashboard loads: it is rebuilt from the files
# it summarises, deleting it is always safe, and tracking it would mean a diff on
# every page view (2026-09-10).
signals/dashboard_index.json
output/*/candidates_index.json
venv/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.env.*
.storage*/
dist-scenarios/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.DS_Store
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
